1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
ChatSprint — a multilingual live quiz for Twitch communities

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:24,000
One desktop studio connects host controls, an OBS viewer preview, and Twitch chat.

3
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Viewers answer inside Twitch with A, B, C, or D. ChatSprint listens through EventSub WebSockets.

4
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Correct and wrong verdicts, scores, streaks, game totals, and the leaderboard update together.

5
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Every viewer keeps a question-by-question answer history. The host can reset cleanly at any time.

6
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:22,000
The interface supports Bangla, English, Arabic, Dutch, and German, plus desktop and mobile layouts.

7
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:38,000
OpenAI Codex planned, built, tested, deployed, and debugged the live Twitch and OBS workflow with us.

8
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:45,000
ChatSprint turns passive viewers into active teammates — one fast answer at a time.
